# Line endings, pinned because this repo is about to be checked out on a
# WINDOWS box for review (item 0HX). Git on Windows defaults to
# core.autocrlf=true, and Python's text mode writes os.linesep, so without
# this the first corpus write there turns part1.json, word_identity.json and
# review_decisions.jsonl - the three authored files - into whole-file diffs
# against the Mac's copy. The authored writers now pass newline="\n" as well;
# this is the half that also covers every derived artifact and every script.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never touched, whatever their content sniffs like.
*.pdf binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.db binary
*.tar binary
